DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
44195::$$$message_0379_0000_0000$$$::"The seven stars are together at last.[lr]::
44196::$$$message_0379_0000_0001$$$::When the seven north stars are assembled, the seven sages shall revive the ancient sealed evil..."::
44197::$$$message_0379_0000_0002$$$::"This tale ends on that tried-and-true note.[lr]::
44198::$$$message_0379_0000_0003$$$::[large]I care nothing for the Holy Grail."[rf]::
44199::$$$message_0379_0000_0004$$$::"Now, offer up thy stars, Servant.[lr]::
44200::$$$message_0379_0000_0005$$$::Make a wish, Loli Gym Shorts.[lr]::
44201::$$$message_0379_0000_0006$$$::Thou art the victor, and the stars shall ordain thy destiny!"::
44202::$$$message_0379_0001_0000$$$::"...That's more or less how it goes."[nolr][p]::
44203::$$$message_0379_0001_0001$$$::"It's time. Are you ready, Taiga?"::
44204::$$$message_0379_0001_0002$$$::"Of course.[lr]::
44205::$$$message_0379_0001_0003$$$::Hehehe, you swine pretending to be a god. What awful task should I give you, I wonder...!"::
44206::$$$message_0379_0001_0004$$$::"Ah. Just so you know, I'll be the one saying the wish. And if it can still grant another wish, then I'll yield it to you."::
44207::$$$message_0379_0001_0005$$$::"Okay. Even if I don't get a turn, you and I have more or less the same wish."::
44208::$$$message_0379_0002_0000$$$::"Your time in the limelight would be mine, too."::
44209::$$$message_0379_0002_0001$$$::"Okay... Now, let the seven souls become one and return from whence they came! I am the victor! Grant my wish!"[nolr][p]::
44210::$$$message_0379_0002_0002$$$::"So you're the one who called for me!"::
44211::$$$message_0379_0002_0003$$$::"Ahhhh! The one guy I didn't expect to show up at the end of the world!"::
44212::$$$message_0379_0002_0004$$$::"Y-yeah. So...are you the Grail?"::
44213::$$$message_0379_0002_0005$$$::"I know not what that is. All I do is grant wishes."::
44214::$$$message_0379_0002_0006$$$::"But know this: only one wish can be granted per century. Think well before you speak."::
44215::$$$message_0379_0002_0007$$$::"Mrgh. So that's how it works... Go ahead, Illya."::
44216::$$$message_0379_0002_0008$$$::"Okay. I know my...no, [font italic=true]our[font italic=false] wish. Holy Grail, let Taiga and I become the main characters!"[nolr][p]::
44217::$$$message_0379_0002_0009$$$::"LOVE MEEEEEEE!"[rf][wm canskip=0][nolr]::
44218::$$$message_0379_0002_0010$$$::[hfu][quad][hfl][quad][hfu]"[hfl]"[hfu]Huh[hfl]Huh[hfu]?[hfl]?[hfu]"[hfl]"[nolr][p]::
44219::$$$message_0379_0002_0011$$$::"...Acknowledged. I shall grant thee a greater measure of fortune."::
44220::$$$message_0379_0002_0012$$$::"Ah... O-ohhhhhh!"[lr]::
44221::$$$message_0379_0002_0013$$$::"Awesome! [font color=0xdd2525]Color [rf][hfchance layer=0]is amazing! After all this time, I've finally evolved my threat level from monochrome to [font color=0xdd2525]2[rf][font color=0x25dd25]5[rf][font color=0x2525dd]6[rf] colors[hfchance layer=0]!"[wm canskip=0]::
44222::$$$message_0379_0003_0000$$$::"Ha, did you see that!? Now I'm on the same level as you regular characters!"::
44223::$$$message_0379_0003_0001$$$::"...I am glad thou approvest. Thus marketh the end of this century's wish."[nolr][p]::
44224::$$$message_0379_0003_0002$$$::[hfu][hfl][hfu]"[hfl]"[hfu]S[hfl]S[hfu][line len=1][hfl][line len=1][hfu][line len=1][hfl][line len=1][hfu][line len=1][hfl][line len=1][large][hfu][large]s[hfl]sea[hfu]ea[hfl]w[hfu]we[hfl]ee[hfu]ed[hfl]d[hfu][line len=1][hfl][line len=1][hfu][line len=1][hfl][line len=1][hfu][line len=1][hfl][line len=1][hfu]![hfl]![hfu]!"[rf][hfl]"[rf]::
44225::$$$message_0379_0003_0003$$$::"...Haaah. I'm starting to understand how Sakura feels."::
44226::$$$message_0379_0003_0004$$$::"That girl's way too patient. She's got too much endurance. And her exits are too corny."::
44227::$$$message_0379_0003_0005$$$::"Heh... Hehe, uhehehehehe!"[nolr][p]::
44228::$$$message_0379_0003_0006$$$::"Fine, then. If you want color so badly, I'll give you all the paint you could ask for! [wm][l][hfstamp layer=1][say storage=HSTRE1_BIR_0080 _name=ブルマイリヤ]Go, Taiga! Turn that seaweed into a [font color=0xff1111 bold=1]tomato[rf]!"::
44229::$$$message_0379_0003_0007$$$::"[current withback=true][fg textoff=0 left=168 index=1000 top=572 time=300 storage=hf_notice3 nowait=1]Whew! Cobra!"[nolr][stoptrans][p]::
44230::$$$message_0379_0003_0008$$$::"Huh? What's this crazy-looking energy? And that lady with a sword zig-zagging at me?[lr]::
44231::$$$message_0379_0003_0009$$$::Wow. She's like the Fujimura Flash."[nolr][p]::
44232::$$$message_0379_0003_0010$$$::"Target obliterated. I'm sure the audience is thrilled with this one-sided massacre of unprecedented proportions, [l][hfchance layer=0][say storage=HSTRE1_TIG_0110 _name=藤ねえ]but for some reason, the victory feels hollow."::
44233::$$$message_0379_0003_0011$$$::"Ahhh. So this is what it's like to profit from stepping on other people... Boo-hoo-hoo."::
44234::$$$message_0379_0003_0012$$$::"Oh, well. Something like that had to get in the way at the very end... I knew it wouldn't go that easily, but it still stings."::
44235::$$$message_0379_0003_0013$$$::"Maybe there really isn't a place for me in this world after all."::
44236::$$$message_0379_0003_0014$$$::"Wait, you two. This outcome fails to reward thy efforts in this war."::
44237::$$$message_0379_0003_0015$$$::"I can no longer grant a wish, but if thou hast any questions, I shall answer."::
44238::$$$message_0379_0003_0016$$$::"For real? [l][hffacechg chara=藤ねえ face=喜2 layer=1 time=200][hfwww layer=1][say storage=HSTRE1_TIG_0150 _name=藤ねえ]Then, question time! Is there any chance of us becoming heroines in the future?"::
44239::$$$message_0379_0003_0017$$$::"I know not. The scope of thy query is beyond my abilities."::
44240::$$$message_0379_0003_0018$$$::"Gah! I can't even get a yes or no answer!?"::
44241::$$$message_0379_0003_0019$$$::"What about you, girl? Art thou still wracked by doubt?"::
44242::$$$message_0379_0003_0020$$$::"...Then, just one from me: is it okay for me to stay here? Or should I go back to the world ruled by maids?"::
44243::$$$message_0379_0003_0021$$$::"Hold that thought! Didst thou just say something crazy!?"::
44244::$$$message_0379_0003_0022$$$::"...There is no problem for now. Thy presence will eventually become irreconcilable, but that lies in the future. When that happens, come find me again."::
44245::$$$message_0379_0003_0023$$$::"Eh?"::
44246::$$$message_0379_0003_0024$$$::[nolr]"Farewell. May we meet again in a hundred years."::
44247::$$$message_0379_0004_0000$$$::"It's gone..."::
44248::$$$message_0379_0004_0001$$$::"...Well, [wvs][hfchance layer=0][say storage=HSTRE1_TIG_0210 _name=藤ねえ]that's that. My job here is done. The Holy Grail War's over, so I'm free again."[nolr][p]::
44249::$$$message_0379_0004_0002$$$::"Huh? I thought you were going to train me. Are you leaving?"::
44250::$$$message_0379_0004_0003$$$::"Hmm. The Servant rules say I have to disappear."::
44251::$$$message_0379_0004_0004$$$::"But don't worry! I'll always be lurking in your heart!"::
44252::$$$message_0379_0004_0005$$$::"Chant this when you're in trouble: [font bold=1]TAIGA MUST DIE! TAIGA MUST DIE![rf][lr]::
44253::$$$message_0379_0004_0006$$$::[se storage=se137.wav][movefg textoff=0 opacity=35 left=7 top=27 time=2000 accel=0 layer=0]Okay, said my piece! Buh-bye!"[wm canskip=0]::
44254::$$$message_0379_0005_0000$$$::"Huh? [l][hfchance layer=0][say storage=HSTRE1_TIG_0290 _name=藤ねえ]Why am I not disappearing?"::
44255::$$$message_0379_0005_0001$$$::"You don't disappear. That's your Servant class, Taiga."::
44256::$$$message_0379_0005_0002$$$::"Unlike other Servants, you can't disappear until the Master who summoned you says so."::
44257::$$$message_0379_0005_0003$$$::"S-[wvs][hfstamp layer=0][say storage=HSTRE1_TIG_0320 _name=藤ねえ]say what!? I've never heard of a class like that! What class [font italic=true]am[font italic=false] I, anyway!?"::
44258::$$$message_0379_0005_0004$$$::"You're a Servant, obviously."::
44259::$$$message_0379_0005_0005$$$::"I know that already! [l][hfangry layer=0][say storage=HSTRE1_TIG_0350 _name=藤ねえ]But there's supposed to be some super cool title that comes with it, like Saber, Believer or Prisoner!"::
44260::$$$message_0379_0005_0006$$$::"It's like I just said.[lr]::
44261::$$$message_0379_0005_0007$$$::Taiga, your class is literally Servant."::
44262::$$$message_0379_0005_0008$$$::"Once you've chosen your Master, you have to serve her for life. You're a [font italic=true]Servant[font italic=false] Servant."::
44263::$$$message_0379_0005_0009$$$::"Guagh! What is this, a bad joke!?[lr]::
44264::$$$message_0379_0005_0010$$$::[hfchance layer=0]What kind of Heroic Spirit is a slave!?"::
44265::$$$message_0379_0005_0011$$$::"Who knows? Maybe humanity gets enslaved in the future and starts a mass emancipation movement." ::
44266::$$$message_0379_0005_0012$$$::"Urgh... Now that you mention it, I think I remember something."::
44267::$$$message_0379_0005_0013$$$::"Me, standing against a grand army of heroines covering the horizon as far as the eye can see. Facing them, the Sub-Character Resistance."::
44268::$$$message_0379_0005_0014$$$::"And then I got carried away and smashed both sides to smithereens."::
44269::$$$message_0379_0005_0015$$$::"Do you believe me now?[lr]::
44270::$$$message_0379_0005_0016$$$::Then behave yourself and stick with me a little longer."::
44271::$$$message_0379_0005_0017$$$::"The Holy Grail War is over, but there will be another. For now, let's go track down the scattered stars."::
44272::$$$message_0379_0005_0018$$$::"Uh, how long exactly is 'a little longer,' my lady?"::
44273::$$$message_0379_0005_0019$$$::"A hundred years, for starters. Until the next war begins."::
44274::$$$message_0379_0005_0020$$$::"That's crazy long! Practically two lifetimes! Nothing 'little' about it at all!"::
44275::$$$message_0379_0005_0021$$$::"No, I'm sure it'll go by in a flash. We'll never get bored as long as we have each other."::
44276::$$$message_0379_0005_0022$$$::"Besides, you said I could be your apprentice, remember? [l][hfchance layer=1][say storage=HSTRE1_BIR_0280 _name=ブルマイリヤ]I'm going to take you up on that."[skip_next_tag len=2][l][br]::
44277::$$$message_0379_0005_0023$$$::"Ehhh... [l][hfsigh layer=0][say storage=HSTRE1_TIG_0460 _name=藤ねえ]Can't argue with that."::
44278::$$$message_0379_0005_0024$$$::"Fine, I'm with you 'til the end of the line!"::
44279::$$$message_0379_0006_0000$$$::"It's kinda weird for my first apprentice to be my first Master, but I'm sure it'll work out!"::
44280::$$$message_0379_0006_0001$$$::"That's the Taiga I know!"::
44281::$$$message_0379_0007_0000$$$::"Then let's head for the Atlantic, first. The next war will be a global voyage spanning the seven seas!"::
44282::$$$message_0379_0007_0001$$$::"What!? That's wild. I gotta get myself a swimsuit!"::
44283::$$$message_0379_0007_0002$$$::"It got scrapped for dev time, but I was totally supposed to have a pool event!"::
44284::$$$message_0379_0008_0000$$$::"Check it out! [l][hfchance layer=0][say storage=HSTRE1_TIG_0530 _name=藤ねえ]My bewitching tiger-striped diving suit!"::
44285::$$$message_0379_0008_0001$$$::"Wooow. [l][hfwww layer=1][say storage=HSTRE1_BIR_0330 _name=ブルマイリヤ]Incredible.[lr]::
44286::$$$message_0379_0008_0002$$$::It's too bad the game never had any sprites of it to show off."[fg textoff=0 left=610 index=3000 top=572 time=400 storage=hf_notice2]::
44287::$$$message_0379_0008_0003$$$::"Ahaha, figures! If they had time to draw my swimsuit, then they probably would've added some more scenes with Rider instead!"::
44288::$$$message_0379_0008_0004$$$::"Dammit! Just you watch![lr]::
44289::$$$message_0379_0008_0005$$$::We'll take over the world on our terms!"::
44290::$$$message_0379_0008_0006$$$::"That's the spirit, Master![lr]::
44291::$$$message_0379_0008_0007$$$::The battle's only just begun!"[nolr][p]::�>